  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA and imagenet_vit_l image encoders, combined with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion (config_039), achieve the highest accuracy (0.724989). This experiment tests scgpt RNA with the same image encoder and aggregation but uses concat fusion instead of weighted. It clarifies whether concat fusion could improve performance when paired with scgpt, despite scvi_n200's prior superiority. This is the final opportunity to explore a critical design choice (fusion method) in a high-performing multimodal setup."
}

